  _headline: Rio bate recorde e passa da marca de 1941
  _headlineEn: River breaks record and tops the 1941 mark
  _body: "A r\xE9gua do cais ficou curta. Em 2024, o Gua\xEDba chegou a 5,35 m; aqui,
    os vizinhos medem a \xE1gua pelo degrau da escada."
  _bodyEn: "The gauge at the docks came up short. In 2024 the Gua\xEDba hit 5.35
    m; here, neighbors measure the water by the stair steps."
